414
00:41:57,240 --> 00:41:58,920
Aún no .

415
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:05,600
Escargots à la Bourguignonne .

416
00:42:07,280 --> 00:42:08,440
¿ Caracoles ?

417
00:42:09,240 --> 00:42:11,440
- Si . - Bueno .

418
00:42:12,360 --> 00:42:16,120
